{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["And when Esau heard that Isaac had further blessed his brother, and commanded him not to take a wife from the daughters of Canaan, he went to his uncle and took his daughter, whose name was Basemath, also Mahalath, like Jethro, who in my opinion is Hobab." "<b>Sister of Nebaioth.</b> He was more honored than all his brothers, or Ishmael had many wives and this one was the sister of Nebaioth."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:06.544879848Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}